Description: Graph Data Science extension for Apache AGE on PostgreSQL
 age_gds bridges Apache AGE (graph storage) with NetworKit (graph
 data-science algorithms). It projects an AGE Cypher graph into a
 NetworKit graph, runs algorithms, and streams results back to SQL.
 .
 Algorithms provided: PageRank, betweenness, closeness, degree,
 eigenvector centrality, Louvain and Leiden community detection,
 label propagation, BFS/Dijkstra shortest paths, link prediction
 (Adamic-Adar, common neighbours, preferential attachment), node
 similarity, and Node2Vec embeddings.
 .
 After installation, enable with: CREATE EXTENSION age_gds;
